ice":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"GTX-2 0.8 Ohm Mesh Coil","offer_id":41673692414007,"sku":"69d25f74bd5c6","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vaporesso-gtx-coils-series-boxes.png?v=1747875529"},{"product_id":"smok-nord-replacement-coils","title":"SMOK Nord Replacement Coils","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe 1.4ohm regular coil is designed for MTL vaping, which can help you enjoy throat hit with it. While the Ceramic 1.4ohm coil is perfectly compatible with CBD oil. Ceramic is a material with great stability and strong high-temperature resistance. When the ceramic is applied into the coil, the coil can be extremely durable and works well even in a higher wattage status.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSMOK NORD Replacement Coils, Features :\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e5 pieces each pack.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.4-ohm regular coil designed for MTL vaping.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCeramic 1.4-ohm coil is perfectly compatible with CBD oil.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWorks well even in a higher wattage status.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"SMOK","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41673692545079,"sku":"SMOK Nord Replacement Coils","price":1940.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Smok_Nord_Coils.jpg?v=1747875560"},{"product_id":"smok-lp2-replacement-coils","title":"SMOK LP2 Replacement Coils","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out the SMOK LP2 Replacement Coils, featuring a 0.23ohm and 0.6ohm in Meshed and Dual Coil options, to deliver delicious vapor in MTL or DL fashion.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCompatibility\u003c\/strong\u003e:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/smok-rpm-4-60w-pod-system\" title=\"RPM 4 Kit\"\u003eRPM 4 Kit\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSMOK LP2 Replacement Coils Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSMOK LP2 Coil Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.23ohm LP2 Meshed Coils - rated for 20-45W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.6ohm LP2 DC Coils - rated for 15-25W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePress Fit Coil Installation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eComes in a pack of five (5).\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"SMOK","offers":[{"title":"Meshed 0.23ohm DL","offer_id":41775198306359,"sku":"S LP2 Replace Coils - Meshed 0.23 Ohm DL","price":1960.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"DC 0.6ohm MTL","offer_id":41775198339127,"sku":"S LP2 Replace Coils - DC 0.6ohm MTL","price":1960.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/smok_lp2_coil_coils_default.png?v=1752510878"},{"product_id":"smok-ofrf-nexmesh-replacement-coils","title":"SMOK OFRF NexMESH Replacement Coils","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out the SMOK OFRF NexMesh Pod Coils (5-Pack), offering a 0.4ohm stainless steel or DC MTL option, bottom press-fit connection, and can be used in a MTL or DTL option.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eQuick Links:\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/smok-ofrf-nexmesh-30w-pod-system\" title=\"SMOK OFRF NexMesh Pod System\"\u003eSMOK OFRF NexMesh Pod Kit\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSMOK OFRF NexMesh Replacement Coils Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNexMesh Coil Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.4ohm SS316 Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.4ohm DC MTL Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePressFit Coil Installation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eComes in a pack of five (5).\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"SMOK","offers":[{"title":"0.4ohm DT MTL Coils","offer_id":41775206563895,"sku":"S OFRF NexMESH Replace Coils - 0.4 ohm DT MTL Coils","price":1899.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"0.4ohm SS316L Coils","offer_id":41775206596663,"sku":"S OFRF NexMESH Replace Coils - 0.4 ohm SS316L Coils","price":1899.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/smok_ofrf_nexmesh_pod_replacement_coils_-_blister_pack_and_box_-_0.4ohm_dc_mtl_coils.jpg?v=1752511634"},{"product_id":"smok-v12-price-replacement-coils-all-resistance","title":"SMOK V12 Price\/RBA Replacement Coils ( All Resistance )","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Smok TFV12 Prince Replacement Coils are unrivaled performance atomizer cores introduced with the amazing TFV12 Cloud Beast Prince Tank. Designed for mid-wattage configurations, it offers phenomenal flavor recreation and excellent vapor production. The TFV12 Prince introduces a variety of exotic configurations, such as V12 Prince Max Mesh, V12 Prince Dual Mesh, V12 Prince Triple Mesh, and Prince X2 Clapton.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCoil packs comes in a pack of (3) three replacement coils\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt is offered in a variety of different sub-ohm coils: V12 Prince-T10, V12 Prince-X6, V12 Prince-Q4, and V12 Prince-M4. The V12 Prince-T10 is the flagship atomizer technology, featuring a 0.12ohm within a Decuple coil cylinder to provide unsurpassed amount of vapor capability, with a wattage range of 60 to 120W.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor building enthusiasts, SMOKTech introduces a dynamic V12 Prince-RBA with pre-installed clapton coils. It features a two-post, dual terminal build deck for user-friendly configurations that accommodates a wide range of coil structures for users to match the sophisticated power of the Smok TFV12 Prince tank.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSMOK TFV12 Prince Replacement Coils Features:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePerformance Enhanced Coil Structure\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eV12-T10 Decuple coil Design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.12 ohm rated for 60-120W, recommended 80-110W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eV12-T6 Sextuple Coil Design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.17ohm rated for 90-320W, recommended 120-180W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eV12 RBA Rebuildable Head\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTwo-Post, Dual Terminal Design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDual Coil Configurations\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eV12 Prince Dual Mesh Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.2ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRated for 70-120W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRecommended 85-105W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"SMOK","offers":[{"title":"V12 Prince Mesh","offer_id":41775207055415,"sku":"S V12 Price\/RBA Replace Coils V12 Prince Mesh","price":1940.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"V12 Prince - X6","offer_id":41775207088183,"sku":"S V12 Price\/RBA Replace Coils V12 Prince - X6","price":1940.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"V12 Prince - T10","offer_id":41775207120951,"sku":"S V12 Price\/RBA Replace Coils V12 Prince - T10","price":1940.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"V12 Prince Max Mesh","offer_id":41775207153719,"sku":"S V12 Price\/RBA Replace Coils V12 Prince Max Mesh","price":1940.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"V12 RBA","offer_id":41775207186487,"sku":"S V12 Price\/RBA Replace Coils V12 RBA","price":1940.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"V12 RBA-T","offer_id":41775207219255,"sku":"S V12 Price\/RBA Replace Coils V12 RBA-T","price":1940.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"V12 - X4","offer_id":41775207252023,"sku":"S V12 Price\/RBA Replace Coils V12 - X4","price":1940.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"V12 - Q4","offer_id":41775207284791,"sku":"S V12 Price\/RBA Replace Coils V12 Q4","price":1940.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"V12 - T6","offer_id":41775207317559,"sku":"S V12 Price\/RBA Replace Coils V12 T6","price":1940.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/SMOK-V12-Prince-MESH-Coils.jpg?v=1752511677"},{"product_id":"voopoo-tpp-dm1-dm2-replacement-coils","title":"VooPoo TPP-DM Replacement Coils","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover the Voopoo TPP Replacement Coils, featuring a mesh heating element to deliver rapid heating, unlocking true flavor from your favorite eJuice.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCompatibility:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eVOOPOO DRAG 3 Starter Kit\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eVOOPOO DRAG X Plus Kit\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eVOOPOO DRAG X Pro Kit\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eVOOPOO DRAG X Plus Pro Kit\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eVOOPOO Argus XT Kit (MAAT Edition Only)\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eVOOPOO Argus MT Kit (MAAT Edition Only)\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eVOOPOO TPP-X Pod Tank\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eVOOPOO TPP Pod Tank\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eVOOPOO TPP Pod Tank 2\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVoopoo TPP Replacement Coils Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVoopoo TPP Coil Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.15ohm TPP-DM1 Coils - rated for 60-80W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.2ohm TPP-DM2 Coils - rated for 40-60W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.15ohm TPP-DM3 Coils - rated for 80-100W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.3ohm TPP-DM4 Coils - rated for 32-40W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePress Fit Coil Installation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eComes in a pack of three (3).\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Voopoo","offers":[{"title":"0.15ohm TPP-DM1 Coils","offer_id":41775207645239,"sku":"Voopoo TPP-DM Replace Coils - 0.15 ohm DM1 Coils","price":1600.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"0.2ohm TPP-DM2 Coils","offer_id":41775207678007,"sku":"Voopoo TPP-DM Replace Coils - 0.2 ohm DM2 Coils","price":1600.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"0.15ohm TPP-DM3 Coils","offer_id":41775207710775,"sku":"Voopoo TPP-DM Replace Coils - 0.15 ohm DM3 Coils","price":1600.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"0.3ohm TPP-DM4 Coils","offer_id":41775207743543,"sku":"Voopoo TPP-DM Replace Coils - 0.3 ohm DM4 Coils","price":1600.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/voopoo-tpp-dm1-coils.jpg?v=1752511736"},{"product_id":"vaporesso-gt-core-coils-3-coils","title":"Vaporesso GT Core Coils (3 Coils)","description":"\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThe Vaporesso  GT \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/replacement-vape-coils\" title=\"Vape Replacement Coils\"\u003eVape Replacement Coils \u003c\/a\u003epresents a dynamic coil option for the \u003cem\u003eNRG Sub-Ohm Tank and the Cascade Tank series\u003c\/em\u003e, deploying traditional cotton and signature cCelll Ceramic with it's innovative structure. The flagship coil head is the 0.15ohm GT 8 Core, with a quad-cylinder structure and wattage range of 50 to 110W. Comes in a pack of three (3).\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCompatibility:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eVaporesso NRG Tank (Includes all of the Revenger Kit series, SWAG Kit, and Switcher Kit)\u003c\/em\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eVaporesso Cascade Tank (requires adapter)\u003c\/em\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eVaporesso Cascade Baby Tank (Includes the Polar 220W Kit and Armour Pro Kit)\u003c\/em\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eVaporesso Cascade Mini Tank\u003c\/em\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eVaporesso Cascade One \/ One Plus Kit\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan data-sheets-userformat='{\"2\":4993,\"3\":[null,0],\"10\":2,\"11\":4,\"12\":0,\"15\":\"arial,sans,sans-serif\"}' data-sheets-value='{\"1\":2,\"2\":\"Vaporesso NRG GT Replacement Coils Features:\\nGT Cores Structure\\n0.3ohm GT cCell Core - rated for 25-40W\\n0.4ohm GT 2 Core - rated for 40-80W\\n0.15ohm GT 4 Core - rated for 30-70W\\n0.2ohm GT 6 Core - rated for 40-130W\\n0.15ohm GT 8 Core - rated for 50-110W\"}' data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eVaporesso NRG GT Replacement Coils Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003eComes in a pack of three (3).\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eGT Cores Structure\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e0.5ohm GT cCell Core - rated for 15-40W\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e0.3ohm GT cCell2 Core - rated for 35-40W\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e0.4ohm GT 2 Core - rated for 40-80W\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e0.15ohm GT 4 Core - rated for 30-70W\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cem\u003e0.15ohm GT 4 Mesh Core - rated for 30-90W\u003c\/em\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e0.2ohm GT 6 Core - rated for 40-130W\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e0.15ohm GT 8 Core - rated for 50-110W\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e0.18ohm GT Mesh Core - rated for 50-90W\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"0.18ohm GT Mesh Coils","offer_id":41775212331063,"sku":"V GT Core Coils (3 Coils) o.18ohm GT Mesh Coil","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"0.15ohm GT 8 Core Coils","offer_id":41775212363831,"sku":"V GT Core Coils (3 Coils) o.15ohm GT 8 Core Coils","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"0.15ohm GT 4 Mesh Coils","offer_id":41775212396599,"sku":"V GT Core Coils (3 Coils) o.15 ohm GT 4 Mesh Coils","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"0.5ohm GT cCELL Coils","offer_id":41775212429367,"sku":"V GT Core Coils (3 Coils) 0.5 ohm GT cCell Coils","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"0.15ohm GT 4 Coils","offer_id":41775212494903,"sku":"V GT Core Coils (3 Coils) o.15ohm GT 4 Coils","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"0.4ohm GT 2 Coils","offer_id":41775212462135,"sku":"V GT Core Coils (3 Coils) o.4ohm GT 2 Coils","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"0.2ohm GT 6 Coils","offer_id":41775212527671,"sku":"V GT Core Coils (3 Coils) o.2ohm GT 6 Coils","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"0.3ohm GT cCELL2 Coils","offer_id":41775212560439,"sku":"V GT Core Coils (3 Coils) o.3ohm GT cCell2 coils","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vaporesso_nrg_gt_replacement_coils_-_gt_4_coil.jpg?v=1752512237"},{"product_id":"vaporesso-gti-replacement-coil-series","title":"Vaporesso GTi Replacement Coil Series (5-Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eShop the Vaporesso GTi Replacement Coils, featuring a 0.2ohm and 0.4ohm Mesh Coil for delivering delicious flavor and vapor from your favorite eJuice.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuick Links:\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-itank\" title=\"Vaporesso iTank\"\u003eVaporesso iTank\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVaporesso GTi Replacement Coils Features:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVaporesso GTi Coil Series\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.15ohm GTI Mesh Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.2ohm GTi Mesh Coils - rated for 60-75W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.4ohm GTi Mesh Coils - rated for 50-60W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.5ohm GTi Mesh Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePress Fit Coil Installation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"GTi 0.15 Ohm Mesh Coil","offer_id":41861506596919,"sku":"V GTi Replace Coil Series (5-Pack) - 0.15 ohm","price":1740.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"GTi 0.2 Ohm Mesh Coil","offer_id":41861506629687,"sku":"V GTi Replace Coil Series (5-Pack) - 0.2 ohm","price":1740.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"GTi 0.4 Ohm Mesh Coil","offer_id":41861506662455,"sku":"V GTi Replace Coil Series (5-Pack) - 0.4 ohm","price":1740.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"GTi 0.5 Ohm Mesh Coil","offer_id":41861506695223,"sku":"V GTi Replace Coil Series (5-Pack) - 0.5 ohm","price":1740.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vaporesso_-_gti_mesh_coils_-_accessories_-_all_types.webp?v=1757067631"},{"product_id":"vape-rechargeable-battery","title":"Vape Rechargeable Battery","description":"\u003cp\u003eThis is Lithium-Ion Vape Battery is high quality 3C rated cell. It comes with a rated voltage of 3.7 volts and a capacity of 2200 and 2600mAh. It is a single cell, compact and powerful battery cell. It is very convenient to install in your project to fulfill the 3.7 Volt requirement with high capacity.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe battery terminals can use in any compatible battery adapter\/holder or they can be permanently soldered to your application’s power source wires.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eModel: ICR-18650\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Shape: Cylindrical\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCapacity (mAh): 2200mAh \u0026amp; 2600mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOutput Voltage: 3.7V\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLong cycle life- 1500cycle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeight: 45gram\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHigh energy density\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Generic","offers":[{"title":"2200mAh","offer_id":41863040335927,"sku":"V Battery - 2200 MAH","price":500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"2600mAh","offer_id":41863040925751,"sku":"V Battery - 2600 MAH","price":600.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/battery-18650-li-ion-rechargeable-2200mah-lithium.webp?v=1757167447"},{"product_id":"vaporesso-nexus-nx-replacement-coil-5-pack","title":"Vaporesso Nexus NX Replacement Coil (5-Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Vaporesso Nexus Replacement Coils is specially designed for the Nexus AIO Kit, featuring the NX CCELL Coil with ceramic technology as well as a traditional cotton of the NX Coil. The utilization of ceramic heating elements delivers tremendous aroma of flavors, with reduction in spit-back and dry hit for longer longevity. Each package comes in a pack of five replacement coils.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVaporesso Nexus Replacement Coil Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.0ohm NX Coil - rated for 7-12W (Traditional Cotton)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOrganic Cotton\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStainless Steel Structure\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41990944948279,"sku":"V Nexus NX Replace Coil (5-Pack)","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vaporesso_nexus_nx_replacement_coils.jpg?v=1763426267"},{"product_id":"vaporesso-euc-universal-ceramic-coil","title":"Vaporesso EUC Universal Coil (5-Pack)","description":"\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThe Vaporesso EUC Replacement Coils (EUC - Eco Universal Coil) is an innovative performance atomizer created with affordability in mind. It is intuitive created, changing the way users typically replacement the atomizer coils. Instead of changing the entire coils, the EUC Replacement Coils only requires the changing of the core instead of the entire metal sleeve. The result is a more cost-effective design, while providing ample performance capability. There are two types of version, a Ceramic type that pays homage to the original cCell structures and a Traditional performance coil, with Kanthal, Nickel, or Stainless Steel heating elements.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThese coils are smaller than others, this is through design and they help reduce waste - while still conducting heat and absorbing eliquid efficiently, the ceramic wick also increases the lifespan of your coils. For best results, tthese coils should be paired with high VG e-liquids that are 60% VG or higher.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eCompatibility:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eAttitude Tank - part of Attitude Kit\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eVeco Tank - part of Tarot Nano Kit\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eEstoc Tank\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eVaporesso EUC Ceramic Coils are for use with the Veco Vape Tank and Estoc Vape Tank. EUC Ceramic Coils are available in 0.5 Ohm. With ceramic wicks rather than the traditional cotton, they are similar in design to the Vaporesso CCELL Coils.\u003cstrong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eContains:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e5 x Vaporesso EUC Replacement Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"EUC - Ceramic 0.5ohm","offer_id":41990945865783,"sku":"V EUC Universal Ceramic Coil (5-Pack)-2","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"EUC - Traditional 0.4ohm","offer_id":41990945898551,"sku":"V EUC Universal Ceramic Coil (5-Pack)-1","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Vaporesso-EUC-Universal-Ceramic-Coil.jpg?v=1763426268"},{"product_id":"smoant-baby-replacement-coils","title":"Smoant Baby Replacement Coils","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out the Smoant Battlestar Baby Replacement Coils, a set of mesh and nichrome coil options presented by Smoant, offering a 0.6ohm Mesh or 1.2ohm Ni80 Coil option to help vaporize delicious eJuice or nicotine salts with ease.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eSmoant Battlestar Baby Replacement Coils Features:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSmoant Battlestar Baby Coil Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.6ohm Mesh Coil - rated for 15W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.4ohm Ni-80 Coil - rated for 10W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePlug 'n' Play Coil Installation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Smoant","offers":[{"title":"0.6ohm Mesh Coils - DTL","offer_id":41990945046583,"sku":"Smoant Baby Replace Coils - 0.6 ohm - DTL","price":1400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"1.4ohm Ni80 Coils - MTL","offer_id":41990945079351,"sku":"Smoant Baby Replace Coils - 1.4 ohm - MTL","price":1400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/smoant_battlestar_baby_replacement_coils_-_0.6ohm_mesh_coils.jpg?v=1763426269"},{"product_id":"smok-acro-replacement-coils","title":"SMOK Acro Replacement Coils","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out the SMOK ACRO Pods (3-Pack), featuring a 2mL capacity, an integrated 0.8ohm Meshed Coil, and is side filled behind a silicone stopper.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatibility:\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/smok-acro-25w-pod-system-kit\" title=\"SMOK Acro\"\u003eSMOK Acro\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSMOK ACRO Replacement Pods Features:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL ACRO Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSide Fill System - Silicone Stoppered\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 0.8ohm Meshed Coil - rated for 12-15W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eComes in a pack of three (3).\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"SMOK","offers":[{"title":"0.8ohm Meshed","offer_id":42030416035895,"sku":"Smok Acro Replace Coils - 0.8 ohm","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"0.6ohm DC MTL","offer_id":42030416068663,"sku":"Smok Acro Replace Coils - 0.6 ohm","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/smok_-_acro_pods_-_cartridge_-_0.8_ohm.webp?v=1766446978"},{"product_id":"smok-vape-pen-replacement-coils","title":"SMOK Vape Pen Replacement Coils","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe SMOK Vape Pen 22 Replacement Coils utilizes the new Vape Pen Coil System that features an elongated design, catering specifically for the Vape Pen Starter Kit.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatibility:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSMOK Vape Pen 22\u003cbr\u003eSMOK Vape Pen 22 LIGHT\u003cbr\u003eSMOK Vape Pen PLUS\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSMOK Vape Pen 22 Replacement Coil Features:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.3ohm Dual Core\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.4ohm X4 Quad Core - rated for 20-50W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.15ohm Vape Pen Mesh Core\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.15ohm Vape Pen Strip Core\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFour Wicking Ports\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e100% Organic Cotton\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePack of 5 Replacement Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"SMOK","offers":[{"title":"0.15ohm Meshed","offer_id":42030437531703,"sku":"Smok V Pen Replace Coils - 0.15 ohm","price":1800.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"0.6ohm DC","offer_id":42030437564471,"sku":"Smok V Pen Replace Coils - 0.6 ohm","price":1800.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/smok_vape_pen_coils_-_packaging.webp?v=1766449333"}],"url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/replacement-vape-coils.oembed","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




